			"notes": "## Changes since 1.13.0:\n- New module: AutoBuild builds a nether portal (optionally lit), wither, iron golem or snow golem in front of you, then turns off; blocks come from the hotbar, offhand or main inventory\n- NewChunks: chunks upgraded from an older version (biomes saved before, blocks rewritten on this load) are now marked being-updated instead of plain old\n- NewChunks: being-updated and old-version chunks always count as old; their detector toggles now only pick the colour (off shows them as old)\n- NewChunks: \"Block palette fallback\" / \"Fallback sections\" renamed to \"Block palette check\" / \"Block sections\""
		},
