			"notes": "## Changes since 1.12.0:\n- New module: SpeedMine with Damage and Haste modes (BreakDelay fixed)\n- NewChunks: reworked detection (palette age, works with Lithium) and rendering, with merged areas and boundary outlines\n- AutoFly: Lawnmower and Goto patterns, Square is now a square spiral with In/Out, On finish action (Stop/Disconnect/Keep heading), remaining distance and ETA, Trail follows old chunks\n- ElytraFly: hold-to-use speed boost key with its own horizontal/vertical speeds\n- StashFinder: Old chunks only filter, chunk age tag, CSV export, disables on death/teleport/disconnect; HUD element now shows the stash count and runtime only\n- Macros: removed the buggy option fade effect"
		},
