			"notes": "## Changes since 1.11.1:\n- StashFinder: history panel and tracking, find position and save fixes\n- Organizer: new sort modes\n- ItemESP: group similar items\n- StreamerMode: options to hide map pictures and sign text\n- Module list HUD: more options, rainbow colouring, HUD editor polish\n- Jesus: new Bob water mode, solid mode fixed under Lithium\n- ElytraFly Bounce: reworked with a single setback path; the Current/Experimental setback modes and the Restart, Restart delay, Setback pause and Minimize packets settings are removed\n- Fixes: PlayerProtect garbling the client GUI and losing your name after an account switch, ChatTweaks mentions matching the sender prefix, AirPlace midair placement and hotbar swapping"
